---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import RetoDemo from '../../components/RetoDemo.astro';
const b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base lang="en" title="TailorMind — Talent" description="Hiring senior AI-empowered developers, remote from Peru.">
  <h1>Hiring senior AI-empowered developers</h1>
  <p class="lead">Remote, from Peru. We pay for the agent tooling you use.</p>
  <p>We hire for <strong>criterio</strong> — the capacity to make sound judgments under uncertainty — and for autonomy with AI tooling.</p>
    <div class="not-prose my-6 p-4 rounded border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
    <p class="font-semibold m-0">Applications open until 8 October 2026</p>
    <p class="m-0 mt-1">One week. Then we close, review everything that came in, and reply to every person.</p>
    <p class="m-0 mt-1"><strong>This round is for people living in Peru only.</strong> The contract is under Peruvian law and this time there are no exceptions: if you live elsewhere, do not apply yet — we would only waste your time.</p>
    <p class="m-0 mt-2 text-amber-900">This is the first round with the new challenge: the requirements and the timings will change with what these deliveries teach us. We say so up front — and if something strikes you as badly measured, say so in your delivery. It counts in your favour.</p>
  </div>

  <RetoDemo lang="en" />

  <p>Curious about what we build? Have a look at <a href="https://tailormind.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tailormind.io</a>.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${b}/en/role/`}>Read the role</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${b}/en/process/`}>How our hiring process works</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${b}/en/flow/`}>Process flow diagram</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${b}/en/assessment/`}>About the assessment</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${b}/en/apply/`}>Apply</a></li>
  </ul>
</Base>
